OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover demolition costs almost
OL,4,Adouble to #33m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe expected cost of the Gateshead
OL,7,FFlyover demolition has passed #32m,
OL,8,Falmost double initial estimates.
OL,10,FThe concrete structure was closed in
OL,11,FDecember 2024 due to fears it could
OL,12,Fcollapse, with a six-month demolition
OL,13,Fcompleted on 1 October.
OL,15,FGateshead Council initially set aside
OL,16,F#18m for the works, but figures due to
OL,17,Fbe presented next week estimate a total
OL,18,Fof #32.6m with the possibility of
OL,19,Ffurther change, the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
