OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover demolition costs almost
OL,4,Adouble to #33m
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council spokesperson said the final
OL,7,Foverall cost of the project was
OL,8,Fexpected to be confirmed in Spring 2027
OL,9,Fonce all remaining works had been
OL,10,Fcompleted.
